[
  {
    "content": "注意力碎片化达到了有史以来最严重的程度",
    "from": 0.12,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 1,
    "to": 2.62
  },
  {
    "content": "我们被分散了",
    "from": 2.62,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 2,
    "to": 3.68
  },
  {
    "content": "四散开来",
    "from": 3.68,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 3,
    "to": 4.24
  },
  {
    "content": "被拉向千百个方向",
    "from": 4.24,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 4,
    "to": 5.5
  },
  {
    "content": "如果我们不解决这个问题",
    "from": 5.5,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 5,
    "to": 6.54
  },
  {
    "content": "作为工作者我们将难以为继",
    "from": 6.54,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 6,
    "to": 8.06
  },
  {
    "content": "作为学习者作为人类",
    "from": 8.06,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 7,
    "to": 9.78
  },
  {
    "content": "这是我给你们的挑战",
    "from": 9.78,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 8,
    "to": 10.94
  },
  {
    "content": "全屏观看这个视频",
    "from": 10.94,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 9,
    "to": 12.32
  },
  {
    "content": "以1倍速播放无干扰",
    "from": 12.32,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 10,
    "to": 14.06
  },
  {
    "content": "因为我将分享五个科学步骤来重建你的注意力",
    "from": 14.06,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 11,
    "to": 19.299
  },
  {
    "content": "时不我待",
    "from": 19.299,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 12,
    "to": 20.47
  },
  {
    "content": "这些方法相当简单",
    "from": 20.47,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 13,
    "to": 21.41
  },
  {
    "content": "但如果你遵循这些步骤",
    "from": 21.41,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 14,
    "to": 22.83
  },
  {
    "content": "你的注意力会得到提升",
    "from": 22.83,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 15,
    "to": 24.93
  },
  {
    "content": "如果我每15分钟刷手机",
    "from": 24.93,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 16,
    "to": 27.29
  },
  {
    "content": "我就无法完成七本书的写作",
    "from": 27.29,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 17,
    "to": 29.61
  },
  {
    "content": "但这些步骤帮助我夺回时间",
    "from": 29.61,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 18,
    "to": 33.22
  },
  {
    "content": "第一步是建立基准",
    "from": 33.22,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 19,
    "to": 35.78
  },
  {
    "content": "拿起一本书开始计时",
    "from": 35.78,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 20,
    "to": 37.88
  },
  {
    "content": "你能连续阅读多久不离开座位或查看手机",
    "from": 37.88,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 21,
    "to": 41.12
  },
  {
    "content": "真的要尽力尝试",
    "from": 41.12,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 22,
    "to": 42.71
  },
  {
    "content": "但不要自我评判",
    "from": 42.71,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 23,
    "to": 43.91
  },
  {
    "content": "如果只有几分钟",
    "from": 43.91,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 24,
    "to": 45.21
  },
  {
    "content": "记录下你的时长",
    "from": 45.21,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 25,
    "to": 46.61
  },
  {
    "content": "这就是你的基准",
    "from": 46.61,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 26,
    "to": 47.85
  },
  {
    "content": "后续步骤会逐步扩展",
    "from": 47.85,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 27,
    "to": 50.81
  },
  {
    "content": "你需要像锻炼肌肉一样训练注意力",
    "from": 50.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 28,
    "to": 53.07
  },
  {
    "content": "从小处开始逐步延展",
    "from": 53.07,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 29,
    "to": 56.69
  },
  {
    "content": "第二步",
    "from": 56.69,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 30,
    "to": 57.39
  },
  {
    "content": "消除注意力吸血鬼",
    "from": 57.39,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 31,
    "to": 59.09
  },
  {
    "content": "你的环境正与你为敌",
    "from": 59.09,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 32,
    "to": 61.35
  },
  {
    "content": "数十亿美元的公司试图劫持你的注意力",
    "from": 61.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 33,
    "to": 64.51
  },
  {
    "content": "因此要设计专注环境",
    "from": 64.51,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 34,
    "to": 67.6
  },
  {
    "content": "这里有一些简单实用的建议",
    "from": 67.6,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 35,
    "to": 70.56
  },
  {
    "content": "一创建无手机区域",
    "from": 70.56,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 36,
    "to": 72.81
  },
  {
    "content": "当你有重要工作时",
    "from": 72.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 37,
    "to": 74.25
  },
  {
    "content": "把手机放在另一个房间",
    "from": 74.25,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 38,
    "to": 75.81
  },
  {
    "content": "二在所有情况下",
    "from": 75.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 39,
    "to": 77.35
  },
  {
    "content": "关闭通知提醒",
    "from": 77.35,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 40,
    "to": 79.11
  },
  {
    "content": "三关闭那七个开着的标签页定时检查",
    "from": 79.11,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 41,
    "to": 84.979
  },
  {
    "content": "你的注意力问题并非全因自身",
    "from": 84.979,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 42,
    "to": 87.239
  },
  {
    "content": "这是环境问题",
    "from": 87.239,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 43,
    "to": 88.759
  },
  {
    "content": "所以修复环境",
    "from": 88.759,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 44,
    "to": 90.159
  },
  {
    "content": "第三步练习",
    "from": 90.159,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 45,
    "to": 91.999
  },
  {
    "content": "深度工作仪式借鉴加勒特·纽波特",
    "from": 91.999,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 46,
    "to": 94.89
  },
  {
    "content": "乔治城大学教授及《深度工作》作者",
    "from": 94.89,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 47,
    "to": 96.99
  },
  {
    "content": "深度工作更容易专注",
    "from": 96.99,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 48,
    "to": 98.91
  },
  {
    "content": "当你建立提示大脑的信号",
    "from": 98.91,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 49,
    "to": 101.16
  },
  {
    "content": "现在开始工作",
    "from": 101.16,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 50,
    "to": 102.66
  },
  {
    "content": "一些作家在写作开始时点燃蜡烛",
    "from": 102.66,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 51,
    "to": 105.58
  },
  {
    "content": "一些程序员会播放同一首歌单",
    "from": 105.58,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 52,
    "to": 107.62
  },
  {
    "content": "一些创业者会坐在同一把椅子上喝同样的茶",
    "from": 107.62,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 53,
    "to": 110.81
  },
  {
    "content": "仪式本身并不重要",
    "from": 110.81,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 54,
    "to": 112.86
  },
  {
    "content": "真正重要的是持续性",
    "from": 112.86,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 55,
    "to": 115.34
  },
  {
    "content": "就像播放一段背景音乐",
    "from": 115.34,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 56,
    "to": 117.42
  },
  {
    "content": "你的大脑早已知道仪式能阻止思维游移",
    "from": 117.42,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 57,
    "to": 121.379
  },
  {
    "content": "开始专注",
    "from": 121.379,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 58,
    "to": 122.419
  },
  {
    "content": "所以今天此刻",
    "from": 122.419,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 59,
    "to": 124.559
  },
  {
    "content": "创建属于你的启动仪式，告诉大脑",
    "from": 125.559,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 60,
    "to": 128.34
  },
  {
    "content": "这是工作时间",
    "from": 128.34,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 61,
    "to": 129.63
  },
  {
    "content": "第四步：运用刹车和运动",
    "from": 129.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 62,
    "to": 131.77
  },
  {
    "content": "大脑并非设计成连续专注十二小时",
    "from": 131.77,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 63,
    "to": 134.93
  },
  {
    "content": "九十分钟后表现力会大幅下降",
    "from": 134.93,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 64,
    "to": 137.41
  },
  {
    "content": "效率会骤降",
    "from": 137.41,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 65,
    "to": 139.05
  },
  {
    "content": "与其硬撑到精疲力尽",
    "from": 139.05,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 66,
    "to": 141.829
  },
  {
    "content": "安排恢复时间",
    "from": 141.829,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 67,
    "to": 143.209
  },
  {
    "content": "短暂休息",
    "from": 143.209,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 68,
    "to": 144.529
  },
  {
    "content": "四处走动拉伸",
    "from": 144.529,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 69,
    "to": 146.12
  },
  {
    "content": "把大脑想象成一个幼儿",
    "from": 146.12,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 70,
    "to": 148.18
  },
  {
    "content": "会崩溃",
    "from": 148.18,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 71,
    "to": 149.3
  },
  {
    "content": "如果不给予",
    "from": 149.3,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 72,
    "to": 150.08
  },
  {
    "content": "零食、小睡和忽视这个事实",
    "from": 150.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 73,
    "to": 152.06
  },
  {
    "content": "不会让你显得英雄",
    "from": 152.06,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 74,
    "to": 153.04
  },
  {
    "content": "只会让你烦躁且低效",
    "from": 153.04,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 75,
    "to": 155.28
  },
  {
    "content": "高效人士明白",
    "from": 155.28,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 76,
    "to": 156.74
  },
  {
    "content": "其他人不懂",
    "from": 156.74,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 77,
    "to": 158.16
  },
  {
    "content": "刹车不是对表现的偏离",
    "from": 158.16,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 78,
    "to": 160.38
  },
  {
    "content": "而是表现的一部分",
    "from": 160.38,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 79,
    "to": 162.22
  },
  {
    "content": "所以今天此刻",
    "from": 162.22,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 80,
    "to": 164.45
  },
  {
    "content": "安排十五分钟散步",
    "from": 164.45,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 81,
    "to": 166.21
  },
  {
    "content": "外出休息",
    "from": 166.21,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 82,
    "to": 167.05
  },
  {
    "content": "接下来一周每天不带手机",
    "from": 167.05,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 83,
    "to": 170.079
  },
  {
    "content": "第五步：重新连接注意力与意义",
    "from": 170.079,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 84,
    "to": 172.279
  },
  {
    "content": "意义",
    "from": 172.279,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 85,
    "to": 172.739
  },
  {
    "content": "听起来像软弱想法",
    "from": 172.739,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 86,
    "to": 174.62
  },
  {
    "content": "但可以是务实策略",
    "from": 174.62,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 87,
    "to": 176.32
  },
  {
    "content": "用它来重新掌控注意力",
    "from": 176.32,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 88,
    "to": 178.6
  },
  {
    "content": "开始任何事前",
    "from": 178.6,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 89,
    "to": 180.08
  },
  {
    "content": "问",
    "from": 180.08,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 90,
    "to": 180.49
  },
  {
    "content": "这为什么重要",
    "from": 180.49,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 91,
    "to": 181.63
  },
  {
    "content": "谁会受益",
    "from": 181.63,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 92,
    "to": 182.43
  },
  {
    "content": "然后写下来并随时查看",
    "from": 182.43,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 93,
    "to": 184.99
  },
  {
    "content": "因为目标驱动坚持",
    "from": 184.99,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 94,
    "to": 187.84
  },
  {
    "content": "当你将注意力与意义相连",
    "from": 187.84,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 95,
    "to": 189.58
  },
  {
    "content": "它不再只是任务而是主动选择",
    "from": 189.58,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 96,
    "to": 192.26
  },
  {
    "content": "我在最后一本书时亲身体会",
    "from": 192.26,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 97,
    "to": 194.28
  },
  {
    "content": "我陷入困境",
    "from": 194.28,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 98,
    "to": 195.26
  },
  {
    "content": "我分心了",
    "from": 195.26,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 99,
    "to": 196.74
  },
  {
    "content": "我在看手机和体育集锦",
    "from": 196.74,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 100,
    "to": 199.24
  },
  {
    "content": "与其做我的工作",
    "from": 199.24,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 101,
    "to": 200.38
  },
  {
    "content": "我意识到问题在于我不知道为什么要写这本书",
    "from": 200.38,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 102,
    "to": 203.86
  },
  {
    "content": "我没有一个",
    "from": 203.86,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 103,
    "to": 204.7
  },
  {
    "content": "当我仔细思考这个问题时",
    "from": 204.7,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 104,
    "to": 206.02
  },
  {
    "content": "这花了几个星期",
    "from": 206.02,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 105,
    "to": 207.28
  },
  {
    "content": "我实际写下我的目标",
    "from": 207.28,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 106,
    "to": 208.82
  },
  {
    "content": "敲出了我的目的",
    "from": 208.82,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 107,
    "to": 209.93
  },
  {
    "content": "明确了它是什么",
    "from": 209.93,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 108,
    "to": 210.97
  },
  {
    "content": "然后贴在墙上作为保持专注的方式",
    "from": 210.97,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 109,
    "to": 215.719
  },
  {
    "content": "最大化我的专注力",
    "from": 215.719,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 110,
    "to": 217.059
  },
  {
    "content": "然后工作开始顺畅起来",
    "from": 217.059,
    "location": 2,
    "music": 0.0,
    "sid": 111,
    "to": 219.719
  },
  {
    "content": "你知道让事情复杂化其实很容易",
    "from": 219.719,
